119	<header class="masthead">
120	<p class="eyebrow">Fortress revival &middot; coordinator skill &middot; skill drafts &middot; version 29 &middot; 23 November 2026</p>
121	<h1>Held rule drafts, version 29</h1>
122	<p class="standfirst">Version 29. Two landed changes still wait for the curator&rsquo;s reading, items 41 and 42, as in version 28. Four proposed changes wait for the curator&rsquo;s yes, in 37 drafts, 43 to 79: the review queue holds only questions; the page of <code>fortress-repo</code> changes shows only rules; a question has one home; and each line of the held list names its exit.</p>
123	</header>
