126	<h2>Sections</h2>
127	<ul>
128	<li><a href="#s1">Landed since the curator&rsquo;s last approval</a></li>
129	<li><a href="#l41">SKILL.md, &ldquo;An ask&rdquo;, the switch-over keeps its definition: change 41</a></li>
130	<li><a href="#l42">SKILL.md, &ldquo;The boot&rdquo;, the facts that POSITIONS cites, then POSITIONS: change 42</a></li>
131	<li><a href="#s2">Proposed changes</a></li>
132	<li><a href="#g1">The review queue holds only questions: drafts 43 to 65</a></li>
133	<li><a href="#g2">The page of <code>fortress-repo</code> changes shows only rules: drafts 66 to 69</a></li>
134	<li><a href="#g3">One home for a question: drafts 70 to 76</a></li>
135	<li><a href="#g4">Each line of the held list names its exit: drafts 77 to 79</a></li>
136	<li><a href="#words">Words used on this page</a></li>
137	</ul>
138	</nav>
