172	<li>Change 42: commits of 17 November, <code>7546299f04</code>, 06:29 UTC, &ldquo;coordinator skill: the boot reads the facts that POSITIONS cites, then POSITIONS&rdquo;, and <code>3acbb2cce2</code>, 06:33 UTC, &ldquo;coordinator skill: fix the cold read flags on the boot step 1&rdquo;. Shown as one change against the text at <code>250c02fd59</code>. The curator&rsquo;s comment of 06:14 UTC on 17 November, on change 35 of this page. The script: <code>explorations/coordinator/tools/positions-facts.sh</code>, whose output at <code>3acbb2cce2</code> is 47 entries in 3 slices, 70K bytes, about 29K tokens. Its provenance: <code>references/sources.md</code>, the lines on &ldquo;The boot&rdquo;, step 1, and on the cold read of <code>7546299f04</code>.</li>
173	</ul>
174	</div>
175	</section>
